      "v": 1,
      "zh": "这事既都完毕，在那里的以色列众人就到犹大的城邑，打碎柱像，砍断木偶，又在犹大、便雅悯、以法莲、玛拿西遍地将邱坛和祭坛拆毁净尽。于是以色列众人各回各城，各归各地。",
      "en": "When all this was over, the Israelites[NOTE:1] who were in the cities of Judah went out and smashed the sacred pillars, cut down the Asherah poles, and demolished[NOTE:2] all the high places and altars throughout Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim, and Manasseh.[NOTE:3] Then all the Israelites returned to their own homes in their cities.[NOTE:4]",
